        "text": "The University of Auckland’s alumni profile connects Elizabeth Iorns’s Science Exchange founding story to her experience as a breast cancer researcher. She encountered difficulties finding collaborators and specialist research facilities outside her institution. The profile describes the resulting idea as a central platform through which scientists could find and outsource experimental work.",
